              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangelani, indlu yenu itshiywe ilunxiwa; kodwa ngithi kini: Kalisoze langibona, kuze kufike isikhathi sokuba lithi: Ubusisiwe ozayo ebizweni leNkosi.",
